WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.635 --> 00:00:03.165
DIRECTOR
Ready. And...

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:03.912
ANTHONY MACKIE
Wait for it...

00:00:04.992 --> 00:00:05.925
DIRECTOR
Action!

00:00:06.793 --> 00:00:08.792
ANTHONY MACKIE
It's an example of opposites attract.

00:00:08.817 --> 00:00:10.626
We couldn't be more different.

00:00:10.651 --> 00:00:12.131
BUCKY BARNES
I got a vibranium arm.

00:00:12.521 --> 00:00:13.716
SAM WILSON
And I can fly.

00:00:14.141 --> 00:00:15.577
SEBASTIAN STAN
There are definitely days where I

00:00:15.577 --> 00:00:16.887
feel like he's going to kill me.
[Laughs]

00:00:17.275 --> 00:00:18.117
SAM WILSON
What's going on in that

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:19.514
cyborg brain of yours?

00:00:19.514 --> 00:00:21.704
Gears turning.
Oh - they're malfunctioning!

00:00:21.704 --> 00:00:22.537
They're on fire!

00:00:22.537 --> 00:00:24.059
BUCKY BARNES
God I hate you.

00:00:24.561 --> 00:00:25.657
SEBASTIAN STAN
He's like, you know, when you have a

00:00:25.657 --> 00:00:28.308
fly in your house
and it just won't go away. [Laughs]

00:00:28.308 --> 00:00:30.308
But you have
a very good dynamic.

00:00:30.332 --> 00:00:31.665
ANTHONY MACKIE
Uh, absolutely not.

00:00:31.665 --> 00:00:34.351
SEBASTIAN STAN
Come on, I'm telling you we got it.

00:00:34.376 --> 00:00:35.447
ANTHONY MACKIE
We have fun with each other.

00:00:35.447 --> 00:00:37.711
And that carries
into these characters.

00:00:38.622 --> 00:00:40.138
BUCKY BARNES
So what's our plan?

00:00:40.368 --> 00:00:41.528
So no plan?

00:00:43.088 --> 00:00:43.993
Great.

00:00:44.675 --> 00:00:47.112
ANTHONY MACKIE
I'm so excited because it's exhilarating.

00:00:47.112 --> 00:00:48.349
SEBASTIAN STAN
It's a throwback to all those

00:00:48.349 --> 00:00:49.992
buddy comedy, action movies.

00:00:49.992 --> 00:00:52.135
You just don't know if
they're going to kill each other or not.

00:00:52.135 --> 00:00:53.137
ANTHONY MACKIE
[Laughs]

00:00:55.429 --> 00:00:56.580
SAM WILSON
That little girl kicked your-

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:57.421
BUCKY BARNES
Ahhh!

